action: Preserve Z02 and Z12 snow-shelter limits: never imply unvalidated snow-cave roof load ratings, keep vent holes open, mark emergency exits, and prohibit indoor stoves (Z02-P41, Z12-P07). @A02,E16,C05
action: Protect household plumbing and heating during extreme cold by clearing exterior snow-drifted furnace PVC vents (Z13-P24) and maintaining safe CO-monitored indoor refuge. @A02,U07
