action: Recognize autumn peak fruiting of lethal Amanita, Galerina marginata, and Cortinarius mushrooms (Z05-P116..P119)—maintaining strict consumption WITHHELD_HOLD and immediate Poison Control referral. @A02,A05,B06,B07
