action: Recognize HAPE (shortness of breath at rest, wet cough) and HACE (ataxia, confusion) at altitude as fatal emergencies whose primary definitive treatment is immediate assisted descent and rescue activation (Z10-P49, Z12-P35). @A08,M13,X09
action: Maintain wide setback from thawing karst bluffs, undercut riverbanks, tension-cracked gravel cuts, and fresh talus cones (Z08-P09, Z08-P32, Z08-P48). @A04,R16
