action: Stay off dark wave-washed wet rocks and coastal basalt ledges where unexpected sneaker waves sweep observers into freezing surf (Z12-P60, Z08-P08), and move immediately to local high ground on tsunami warnings or strong coastal earthquakes (Z12-P61, Z15-P27). @A08,X16,R16
