action: When official emergency authorities order short-term chemical shelter-in-place for an outdoor hazmat plume (Z15-P48), move indoors, shut off HVAC, fans, close windows, vents, seal an interior room briefly as directed, and monitor official updates until all-clear or evacuation orders arrive. @A08,D13
