action: Inspect site drainage, overhead hazard trees, snags, and anchor holding before pitching (Z02-P05, Z02-P11); abandon shelters early if snow loads deform poles or flash drainage approaches (Z02-P49) without assuming unvalidated structural load numbers. @A01,E01,E05,E16
