action: Connect geology directly to operational hazards: northern iron formations deflect compass needles (Z08-P20, Z11-P29); southeastern karst fissures transmit rapid surface contamination into visually clear springs (Z08-P09, Z04-P03). @A04,R16,R20,W03
action: Keep clear of unstable drift gravel cuts, undercut riverbanks, and thawing Paleozoic bluff talus aprons (Z08-P09, Z08-P32). @A04,R16
