verify: Lawful dead-downed sourcing, grain, rot screening, and B007–B011 photo, review holds remain aligned. @R09,R15
stop: Stop cutting live trees, transporting quarantined firewood, or trusting cracked, punky poles under load. @R09,R15,K09
reviewer: Forestry botanist and woodworking specialist

