action: Verify Minnesota State Park rules separately: zero rock, mineral, soil, root removal or public trapping, with narrow personal berry, mushroom allowances only where explicitly authorized by current statute (Z08-P56, Z05-P10, Z07-P06). @A06,R09,B23,L07
action: Check current DNR regulations, tribal sovereign boundaries, and explicit private-landowner permission on multi-use forests, WMAs, and private parcels—never assuming an emergency grants a legal exemption (Z06-P03, Z06-P06, Z07-P03). @A06,H01,H02,L01
failure: Treating adjacent parks, SNAs, WMAs, tribal waters, and private fields as interchangeable leads to trespass and resource-protection violations. @R08,R10,H02,L07
