Z16-P42 | Material Non-Certification Boundary: Sight Never Proves Load or Safety | New manuscript (Z16 P20 governance index)
objective: Enforce the encyclopedia-wide separation between conceptual material recognition and engineering load, anchor, or chemical safety certifications.
applies: Any cross-zone decision involving wild timber, rock ledges, natural fibers, knots, or salvaged scrap.
