action: Match knot geometry to load behavior (e.g., stopper backups on slick synthetics, bowline, figure-eight loop dressing, taut-line, trucker hitch tensioning) without assigning invented breaking-strength ratings (Z09-P11..P21). @A04,K05,K06
action: Preserve Z09-P44 physics warning: a 180-degree pulley redirect can nearly DOUBLE the force applied to the redirect anchor compared with the load weight—requiring rated hardware and qualified rigging review for heavy loads. @A04,K06,K12
