failure: Underestimating pulley redirect anchor multiplication or trusting undressed slick-cord knots causes sudden rigging failure. @K05,K06,K12
verify: Proper knot dressing, backup stoppers, anchor force multiplication awareness, and zero life-safety rigging limits hold. @K05,K06
