reviewer: Cartography, SAR, and aviation-safety reviewer

Z16-P45 | Layperson First-Aid, Wound Care, Splinting and Monitoring Index | New manuscript (Z16 P20 clinical index)
objective: Index layperson, dispatcher, and clinician boundaries across trauma, wounds, burns, fractures, seizures, hypoglycemia, and documentation in Z10.
applies: Backcountry and home emergency stabilization awaiting qualified EMS, clinical care.
equipment: Full offline reader (Z10, Z01), primary zone cards, and local emergency and agency references.
diagram: Locate Z10, Z01 cards | Preserve exact stop & limits | Defer to full zone card
