action: Recognize lethal gyromitrin false morels (brain-lobed chambered Gyromitra, Z05-P118), delayed renal-failure webcaps (Cortinarius cobweb veil + rusty spores, 2–14+ day silent onset, Z05-P119), violent GI jack-o-lanterns (Omphalotus on wood, orange flesh, Z05-P120), and green-spored lawn parasols (Chlorophyllum molybdites, Z05-P121). @A05,B08
action: Act immediately on ANY suspected wild mushroom ingestion without waiting for 6–24 hour delayed symptoms or trusting day-two false recovery: save uneaten pieces in dry paper bags and call 1-800-222-1222 or 911 at once (Z05-P133..P135). @A09,B06,B08,B09
